{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/676ace9d55a53260229a79a4d830cd41.avif?t=1764346977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras_big/676ace9d55a53260229a79a4d830cd41.avif?t=1764346977 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious miasma spreads across the world, turning local wildlife into terrifying monsters. Guilds, once dedicated to everyday tasks, are now the last line of defense against this growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/4a2e2adaf2872b8b36f17ec20c316790.avif?t=1764346977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras_big/4a2e2adaf2872b8b36f17ec20c316790.avif?t=1764346977 width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild of Hunters is a turn-based RPG where you lead a guild of hunters, recruit new members, negotiate item prices with merchants, and embark on dangerous expeditions through a medieval world filled with secrets and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/8dea9ba7da8afae824730ba68c474176.poster.avif?t=1764346977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/8dea9ba7da8afae824730ba68c474176.webm?t=1764346977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/8dea9ba7da8afae824730ba68c474176.mp4?t=1764346977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the perfect team, combining unique skills and strategies to face dark creatures and uncover the origin of the corruption plaguing the land. With deep combat mechanics, resource management, and impactful choices, every decision shapes the future of your guild, and the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/95742ff6dabc1c1b55c4a963d9edc5a1.avif?t=1764346977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras_big/95742ff6dabc1c1b55c4a963d9edc5a1.avif?t=1764346977 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Recruit and train hunters with different skills and specializations. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Trade with merchants to get the best equipment and supplies. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Explore dangerous regions, from haunted forests to forgotten ruins. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Engage in tactical turn-based battles, where strategy is key to victory. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Uncover the truth behind the miasma and face increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/a85cda9b3b1087b575a37c3ea8f167a3.poster.avif?t=1764346977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/a85cda9b3b1087b575a37c3ea8f167a3.webm?t=1764346977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/a85cda9b3b1087b575a37c3ea8f167a3.mp4?t=1764346977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your guild, hunt the monsters, negotiate with merchants, upgrade your itens and restore peace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610380?t=1764346977","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/4e6f4e80c711996680e52c70706cb32c7e531a23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764346977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/d371b1590dc3a146155afb6b625a640b2048fe84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764346977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/d371b1590dc3a146155afb6b625a640b2048fe84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764346977","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3676890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/676ace9d55a53260229a79a4d830cd41.avif?t=1764346977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras_big/676ace9d55a53260229a79a4d830cd41.avif?t=1764346977 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious miasma spreads across the world, turning local wildlife into terrifying monsters. Guilds, once dedicated to everyday tasks, are now the last line of defense against this growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/4a2e2adaf2872b8b36f17ec20c316790.avif?t=1764346977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/