 get the best equipment and supplies. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Explore dangerous regions, from haunted forests to forgotten ruins. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Engage in tactical turn-based battles, where strategy is key to victory. <br>\ud83d\udd39 Uncover the truth behind the miasma and face increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/a85cda9b3b1087b575a37c3ea8f167a3.poster.avif?t=1764346977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/a85cda9b3b1087b575a37c3ea8f167a3.webm?t=1764346977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/extras/a85cda9b3b1087b575a37c3ea8f167a3.mp4?t=1764346977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your guild, hunt the monsters, negotiate with merchants, upgrade your itens and restore peace.</p>","developers":["Sunny Horizon Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610380/9a8be95bb72dbe5532a6ccc98b57bb03313d3a0a/header.jpg?t=1764346977","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (Dual Core) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</stron